==English==

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun|-}}

# {{context|pathology|lang=en}} A sometimes fatal condition resulting from the formation of [[nitrogen]] bubbles in the [[blood]] and tissues, because of too rapid decompression, seen especially in deep-sea divers ascending rapidly from a dive. It is characterized by severe pains in the joints and chest, skin irritation, cramps, [[nausea]], and [[paralysis]].

====Synonyms====
* [[aeroembolism]]
* [[aeroemphysema]]
* [[the bends]]
* [[caisson disease]]

